        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rishabh Shukla, J. K. Rowling\n- Roles: film actor, television actor, voice-dubbing artist, Hindi dubbing actor\n- Characters: Lord Voldemort\n- Works: Harry Potter\n- Topics: Hindi language\n\nFacts:\n- Rishabh Shukla is an Indian film actor, television actor, and voice-dubbing artist.\n- Rishabh Shukla speaks Hindi as his mother tongue.\n- Rishabh Shukla is known in Hindi dubbing for voicing the fictional character Lord Voldemort.\n- Lord Voldemort is the main antagonist in J. K. Rowling's Harry Potter novels.",
